 "books": {
  "111a31fa": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 5,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Devlin warned us that if we tried to face the Scourge, then we were doomed.  He told us this when they first entered Tirisfal Glades, well before they encircled our home.  Perhaps he was pleading with us to leave, or perhaps he was gloating.\r\n\r\nIt was always hard to understand Devlin's motives.  Since he was a child, he was a mystery to us.",
   "time": 1793905194,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "37cabe37": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Lord Bethor Iceshard,\r\n\r\nAs per your instructions, I send to you the agent you requested.  It is the bearer of this note.\r\n\r\nThis person has shown to be dependable and able to follow orders, is proven against the forces of the Scourge, and is my choice for your mission.\r\n\r\nMay She reign supreme,\r\n-Magistrate Sevren\r\n\r\n",
   "time": 1793905607,
   "title": "Sevren's Orders",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "7ca17b24": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Scourge have continued to slip through both the Bulwark and the eastern waystation, their numbers growing by the day. How such a failure in our defenses is allowed to persist is beyond my reckoning.\r\n\r\nAs noted in my previous reports, the paltry allotment of guards assigned to Brill is insufficient for what comes for us. It is not a matter of if we will be overrun, but when. And once Brill falls, it shall serve as the perfect staging ground to lay siege to the Undercity.\r\n\r\nIt is not my recommendation, but my demand that reinforcements be dispatched from their luxurious posts in the Undercity to defuse the situation while we still possess the opportunity.\r\n\r\n--Deathguard Dillinger",
   "time": 1793902428,
   "title": "Dillinger's Report",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "7ecb52e7": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 3,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Devlin despaired and sought an escape from our ill fortunes, and in doing so he made a pact with the Scourge.  I do not know what price was promised him for his betrayal, but I'm sure it was laced with lies.\r\n\r\nIf you see my brother, then flee from him.  He is a fiend.  A few nights ago he murdered two of our watchmen and let a small group of Scourge through the breach, leading them to where many more of us slept.",
   "time": 1793905194,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "a0204b07": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 2,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I fear my father made a grave error when he decided to remain and defend our home.  The forces of the Scourge rage through Tirisfal Glades, and although we are well fortified and well stocked, after the betrayal of my brother Devlin we lack the strength and numbers to withstand their continued assault.\r\n\r\nIf you receive this letter, Yvette, then know that Devlin is a traitor.",
   "time": 1793905194,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "d2638e1d": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 1,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Dearest Yvette,\r\n\r\nI will entrust this letter to our fastest runner.  I pray he can find a way through the forces surrounding us.  And I pray you read these words, for they are the last you will hear of me.\r\n\r\nMy only comfort in these dark days is the relief I feel, knowing that you are free of my fate.",
   "time": 1793905247,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "ee343678": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 6,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "But he was right.  We are doomed.  The Agamand family line will end.  Although I still live, I know I will soon be dead.\r\n\r\nI am not afraid, and I do not regret remaining with my family.  But my last thoughts will be of you.\r\n\r\nLive on, my beloved Yvette, and I will find peace,\r\n-Thurman",
   "time": 1793905195,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "f268393e": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 4,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Their ambush was brutal.  They slew a third of us before we could take them down.  Now, we barely have enough men to watch our borders.  It is only a matter of time before our wearying guard drops and the Scourge attack.\r\n\r\nAnd although I saw Devlin's face amidst the desperate men and gaunt-faced Scourge on that cursed night, he slipped away before I could catch him.  He might be dead, or he might still live as an agent of the Scourge.\r\n\r\nEither way, he is a monster.",
   "time": 1793905194,
   "title": "Thurman's Letter",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  }
 },
